OL,3,GNEWSAWe fear for our lives after being
OL,4,Atold our abusive exes will be freed
OL,5,Afrom jail early
OL,6,
OL,7,FClaire Milne's ex-husband, Robert
OL,8,FDales, was convicted in March this year
OL,9,Fof coercive control and possessing
OL,10,Foffensive weapons, including samurai
OL,11,Fand ninja swords. He was sentenced to
OL,12,Fthree years in prison.
